// PiWidget Windows resource script.
//
// Keep this file ASCII-only: rc.exe reads .rc in the system ANSI codepage,
// so UTF-8 text here can break the build. Explanations live in build.rs.
//
// The resource ID MUST stay 1: GPUI's Windows backend loads the window icon
// with LoadImageW(module, PCWSTR(1), IMAGE_ICON, ...).

1 ICON "assets/icons/icon.ico"
